          "summary": "Add general-advertising and unsolicited-approach carve-outs to the mutual non-solicitation clause.",
          "comment": "[Playbook] We can live with this mutual, narrowly scoped non-solicit, but we need the standard carve-outs so that general job postings, recruiter searches not targeted at the other party, and unsolicited approaches by individuals do not create a breach. This tracks our playbook fallback position of a 12-month non-solicit limited to personnel involved in the Services with a general-advertising exclusion.",
